START

Display:
1. IT
2. Healthcare
3. Engineering

Input Sector
Input DemandIncrease

SWITCH(Sector)

Case 1:
   Display "IT Sector"
   Break

Case 2:
   Display "Healthcare Sector"
   Break

Case 3:
   Display "Engineering Sector"
   Break

Default:
   Display "Invalid Sector"

IF DemandIncrease > 20 THEN
   Display "High Demand Alert"
ELSE
   Display "Normal Demand"

END IF

STOP
